            desc = "Test mode control of the FE PHY MDIO and MDCKIO In this mode, the FE PHY is communicated by the MDIO and [21]                        RW _test             Note: The patch mode and the I/O test mode do not take effect at the same time. fun_fephy_patch_ output of the FE PHY in patch mode mdio_enb fun_fephy_patch_";
